   "titulo": "Glostar of + infinitive",
   "texto": [
    "To say that you like to do something, use **gostar de** + infinitive: **Gosto de cozinhar** (I like to cook).",
    "If you talk about one thing, use **gostar de** + name: **Gosto de música** (I like music)."
   ]
