   "titulo": "Prefer",
   "texto": [
    "**Preferir** (prefer) goes with infinitive: **Prefiro ler** (I prefer to read).",
    "To compare two things, use **a**: **Prefiro chá a café** (I prefer tea to coffee). Eye: **prefiro chá do que café** is also said."
   ]
